    <bpmn:process id="W_W1881" name="W1881. Trade Account Quarterly Business Review &amp; Relationship Health Assessment" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Quarterly review cycle
Frequency: Quarterly for key accounts (top 50); semi-annual for growth accounts
Volume: ~50 key account QBRs/quarter; ~100 growth account reviews semi-annually
Owner: Account Manager
Participants: Account Manager, Trade Professional, VP Store Operations, Category Manager
Source: workflow W1881 — Trade Account Quarterly Business Review &amp; Relationship Health Assessment</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1881_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1881_Lane1" name="Account Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1881_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1881_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1881_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1881_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1881_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1881_Start3" name="Quarterly review cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1881_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1881_Task4" name="Account Manager prepares QBR package for each key account: (a) trailing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Account Manager prepares QBR package for each key account: (a) trailing 12-month purchase summary: total spend, spend by category, spend vs. prior year, (b) pricing analysis: is the account receiving competitive pricing? Compare to market and peer accounts, (c) product penetration: what % of BuildRight categories does the account purchase from? Identify categories where account buys from competitors, (d) service metrics: delivery performance, order accuracy, fill rate, complaint resolution time, (e) account health score: composite of spend trend, payment behavior, engagement frequency, satisfaction indicators
Responsible (R): Account Manager
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: 1–2 hours/account</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1881_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1881_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1881_Task5" name="Account Manager conducts QBR meeting with trade professional: (a) present…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Account Manager conducts QBR meeting with trade professional: (a) present purchase analysis and trends, (b) discuss upcoming projects and anticipated material needs, (c) identify opportunities: (i) categories where BuildRight can capture more of the contractor&#x27;s spend, (ii) new products or services relevant to contractor&#x27;s business, (iii) project pipeline that BuildRight can support with quantity pricing and dedicated fulfillment, (d) address any service issues or complaints from the contractor, (e) discuss credit and pricing adjustments if warranted
Responsible (R): Account Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 1–2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1881_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1881_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1881_Task6" name="Post-QBR: Account Manager updates CRM with: (a) meeting notes and action items…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Post-QBR: Account Manager updates CRM with: (a) meeting notes and action items, (b) updated project pipeline information, (c) any pricing or credit change requests (route to appropriate approver), (d) updated account health score and risk assessment, (e) follow-up actions with due dates
Responsible (R): Account Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1881_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1881_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1881_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1881_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1881_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-370 (ensure controlled execution — Trade Account Lifecycle &amp; Relationship Management (PA-43.1).) | - operational: Account Manager review and approval gate
Owner: Account Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1881_Assoc9" sourceRef="W1881_Annotation8" targetRef="W1881_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
