    <bpmn:process id="W_W1884" name="W1884. Trade Account Offboarding &amp; Account Closure" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Trade professional requests closure; account dormant &gt; 365 days; account terminated for payment default
Frequency: ~200–400 account closures/year
Volume: Per account
Owner: Account Manager
Participants: Account Manager, Credit Analyst, Finance, Trade Professional
Source: workflow W1884 — Trade Account Offboarding &amp; Account Closure</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1884_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1884_Lane1" name="Account Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1884_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1884_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1884_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1884_Lane2" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1884_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1884_Lane3" name="VP Store Operations">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1884_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1884_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1884_Start5" name="Trade professional requests closure; account dormant &gt; 365 days; account terminated for…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1884_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1884_Task6" name="Offboarding trigger: (a) voluntary: trade professional requests account closure…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Offboarding trigger: (a) voluntary: trade professional requests account closure (business closure, relocation, switching to competitor), (b) involuntary — dormancy: account dormant &gt; 365 days per W1882, (c) involuntary — payment default: account written off per W81 (bad debt) or consistently late payments despite interventions
Responsible (R): Account Manager / Credit Analyst
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1884_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1884_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1884_Task7" name="Finance checks account financial status: (a) outstanding AR balance: must be…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Finance checks account financial status: (a) outstanding AR balance: must be PHP 0 before closure (or converted to COD for remaining balance), (b) outstanding PDCs: return or destroy per W1380, (c) security deposit refund (if applicable), (d) unresolved disputes: document and transfer to general AR for collection
Responsible (R): Finance
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 15–30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1884_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1884_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1884_Task8" name="Account Manager closes account in CRM: (a) set account status to &quot;Closed&quot; with…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Account Manager closes account in CRM: (a) set account status to &quot;Closed&quot; with reason code, (b) document closure reason and any exit interview insights, (c) retain account history for 10 years per BIR retention requirement, (d) remove trade pricing access, (e) if voluntary closure: ask for exit feedback and permission to re-contact if contractor returns to the area
Responsible (R): Account Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 15–30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1884_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1884_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1884_Task9" name="Quarterly: VP Store Operations reviews closure patterns: (a) closure rate by…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Quarterly: VP Store Operations reviews closure patterns: (a) closure rate by reason, (b) closure rate by segment and region, (c) competitive win/loss analysis from exit interviews, (d) systemic issues identified from closure reasons
Responsible (R): VP Store Operations
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: 1 day/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1884_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1884_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1884_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1884_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1884_Annotation11">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-370 (ensure controlled execution — Trade Account Lifecycle &amp; Relationship Management (PA-43.1).) | - operational: Account Manager review and approval gate
Owner: Account Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
